      "checked_conclusions": [
        "The 1.5-second value is the bleed refresh duration. Existing tick scheduling remains; once the duration expires, an interval tick deals damage using current stacks and then removes one stack. The remaining-stack lifetime formula and 4/16-stack power examples are correct.",
        "The smoothstep inputs are power_level values, not fixed health damage: 4 stacks produce 78.125 and 16 stacks produce 500.",
        "The held-slot condition is checked for new proc events. It does not clear the target's existing shared bleed when the weapon is switched away.",
        "The first projectile impact does not immediately create an impact explosion. Fuse and any later eligible impact explosions use the instant template; only close-hit targets receive the close profile required by this blessing.",
        "Close hit is measured from the explosion source, adjusted by the target breed explosion_radius, with a sticking target also treated as close.",
        "The four CheckProcFunctions identifiers in the wrapper are truthy function references without calls, so their apparent damaging-hit, non-kill, explosion-type, and minion tests are not gates. The effective custom gate is the exact close damage-profile name.",
        "Metadata restriction `thumper_p2` correctly maps the inventory/UI weapon identifier `ogryn_thumper_p2`; the item metadata category is `bespoke_thumper_p2`.",
        "The other localized RAW entry uses English Shrapnel / Traditional Chinese 榴霰彈 on a different key and hash; it is not this blessing. The blessing's exact RAW is 破片四濺."
      ],
